"Green is an article-level repository route in OpenAlex. A journal listed with Green articles is "
"not necessarily a fully Green Open Access journal."
msgstr ""
"Green ist eine Artikel-Level-Repository-Route in OpenAlex. Eine Zeitschrift, die in Green-"
