"Deduplicates works by DOI and groups them by publication_year and native OpenAlex oa_status. "
"Years without articles in a category are shown as zero."
msgstr ""
"Dedupliziert Werke von DOI und gruppiert sie mit publication_year und nativem OpenAlex oa_status."
