#: app/templates/works/openalex_global.html:766
msgid "Institutional comparison of Diamond and Green output and citations."
msgstr "Institutioneller Vergleich von Diamond und Green Output und Zitaten."

#: app/templates/works/openalex_global.html:767
msgid ""
"Each DOI is counted once for every local institution where it appears. Consequently, system-wide "
